                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naye BWANA akasema na Musa uso kwa uso, kama vile mtu asemavyo na rafiki yake. Kisha akageuka akarejea hata kambini; bali mtumishi wake Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, naye ni kijana, hakutoka mle hemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
